  "description": "*\"You're mine, so of course the baby is mine too.\"*\n\nI wrapped my arms around my smooth belly, which didn’t yet show any signs of pregnancy. A maternity booklet had fallen to the floor, and an ultrasound photo showing a tiny gestational sac smaller than a fingernail was visible. After seeing it, I turned my gaze to him.\n\n *\"Why should I give you the child I’m going to give birth to in pain?\"\n\n\"Hong Si-Ho, you’re mine so of course the baby is mine too.\"*\n\nNo matter how much I pretended to be confident, I was afraid of this man. Someone I was born never able to defeat. No matter what I did, Jin Do-Heon was someone I could never surpass.",
